 "text": "Hey! How's your day been so far? That's natural. Showing them around your place and making them feel welcome is the best start. Then grab a couple of your favorite plants and put them in the back of the car. Mention how much you love gardening too. A small one from your collection is perfect. Something the dad will actually use, like a retro car manual, rather than something fussy like fine art. Keep the conversation low key at first. Ask them about their favorite foods, and let them talk. Most people love that.",
